    "summary": "Errata to the Ynnari Venom. Its [Lithe Embarkation](vsdata:ability/aeldari.ynnari-venom.lithe-embarkation) ability adds that the unit may embark within this **TRANSPORT** even in a turn in which it disembarked from it.\n\nThe second paragraph of its Transport section now says: before the battle, as the Declare Battle Formations step begins, you may pick 1 **YNNARI KABALITE WARRIORS** or **YNNARI WYCHES** unit of yours not split before and split it into 2 units with model counts as equal as possible, noting which models form each. After the split:\n\n- 1 new unit must begin the battle inside this **TRANSPORT**\n- the other may begin inside another **TRANSPORT** or be deployed on its own",
    "citations": [
